I know others have recently posted about seeing this error but I'm unable to reproduce it on either a Linux or MacOS environment. Attached is the .RData object from when I ran your code, including the resultant output.

I did put in a few fixes a couple months ago for userGWAS that was causing this error to pop up for smooth_check so this easiest explanation would be that we are running just slightly different version of GenomicSEM. Those fixes were relatively minor so it didn't merit listing it as a new version number, so while we are both running version 5 I wonder if you re-installed Genomic SEM, restarted R, and gave it another go if you would still get the same error?

Best,
  Andrew

